---
title: VibeFinder 2.0 — grounded recommendations
---

flowchart TD
    Q([Listener request<br/>free text]) --> NLU[Intent parser<br/>lexicon, no model<br/>genre · mood · energy · decade]
    NLU -->|nothing recognised| REFUSE[Decline:<br/>catalog can not filter on those terms]
    NLU --> RETRIEVE[Context retriever<br/>custom notes<br/>study · gym · rainy · road trip]
    RETRIEVE --> RANK[Recommender<br/>unchanged from 1.0<br/>weighted scoring + diversity]
    RANK --> FACT[Fact sheet<br/>one song's real values<br/>and score]
    FACT --> EXPL[Explainer<br/>stub or Gemini<br/>facts only]

    EXPL --> VER{Verifier<br/>numbers and names<br/>match the fact sheet?}

    VER -- "claim support ≥ 0.80<br/>and no invented names" --> OK([Answer returned<br/>+ audit report])
    VER -- "below threshold" --> RETRY{Attempts left?}
    RETRY -- "yes: strict prompt" --> EXPL
    RETRY -- "no" --> CAVEAT[Return with caveat:<br/>state that it is unverified]

    OK --> TRACE[(JSONL trace)]
    CAVEAT --> TRACE
    REFUSE --> TRACE
    EVAL[[harness.py<br/>16 queries × 2 modes<br/>pass / fail]] -.->|drives| Q
    EVAL -.->|reads| TRACE

    classDef guard fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#d9822b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef core fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#4285f4,stroke-width:2px
    classDef out fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#34a853,stroke-width:2px
    class NLU,VER,RETRY guard
    class RETRIEVE,RANK,FACT,EXPL core
    class OK,REFUSE,CAVEAT out
